Compile if __SIZEOF_POINTER__ is equal to 8 and __CHAR_BIT__ is equal to 8:
    Say "64-bit bytes".
Elif __SIZEOF_POINTER__ is equal to 4:
    Say "32-bit".
End compile if.
Compile if __SIZEOF_INT__ is at least 4 and __SIZEOF_LONG_LONG__ is at least 8:
    Say "wide ints".
End compile if.
Compile if __linux__ is defined or __APPLE__ is defined or _WIN32 is defined:
    Say "known host".
End compile if.
Compile if __STDC_UTF_16__ is defined and __STDC_UTF_32__ is defined:
    Say "utf".
End compile if.
